  "notes": [
    "High-voltage I/O, medium-voltage pre-drive I/O, and built-in Type-C resistors vary by orderable package SKU and must not be inherited from the series globally.",
    "All 48 LQFP leads, 35 GPIO, and the functions published for the C8T7 bond-out are captured. Digital remap routes were cross-checked against RM Tables 6-9 through 6-14, AFIO_PCFR1, and EVT definitions; hardware behavior is not yet verified.",
    "Unlike C8U7, C8T7 exposes CC1 and CC2 without the R suffix and therefore is not assigned the built-in controllable Type-C Rd components.",
    "RM Table 6-15 labels ADC_ETRGIN_RM=0 as PB6 and =1 as PA14, but datasheet Table 2-1, the RM register description/reset value, and the EVT set-bit implementation consistently indicate 0=PA14 and 1=PB6. This record follows the latter three sources and flags Table 6-15 as a likely documentation error."
  ]
